  "prefLabel": "He-P 4021.04 Records of Tests for Leakage or Contamination of Sealed Sources",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4021.04 Records of Tests for Leakage or Contamination of Sealed Sources. Records of tests for leakage or contamination of sealed sources shall be kept in units of becquerel or microcurie and maintained for inspection by the department of health and human services radiological health section (DHHS/RHS) for 5 years after the records are made.\n\nSource. #5903, eff 2-1-95; ss by #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8481, eff 11-5-05; ss by #10604, eff 5-23-14; ss by #14091, eff 10-1-24",
